# direnv config for deployments-pve (personal, git-ignored).
#
# Loads the flake's `default` devShell (nix/shell.nix, mode = "dev") — the same
# environment `nix develop` and the `fleet` CLI wrapper use. Run `direnv allow`
# once after editing this file.
#
# Recommended: install nix-direnv for fast, cached shell reloads:
#   https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv
# With nix-direnv present, `use flake` below is transparently accelerated.

# Fail loudly if direnv is too old to understand `use flake`.
strict_env

use flake
